  /Title (4.5 Generative AI may be used to understand concepts, debug errors, compare implementation options, or improve explanations. It must not replace analysis, backlog decisions, team communication, code review, or your own understanding. Significant AI-generated code must be explained in the pull request.)
  /Dest 517 0 R
>>
endobj

