  /Dest 518 0 R
>>
endobj

36 0 obj
<<
  /Parent 29 0 R
  /Next 37 0 R
  /Prev 35 0 R
  /Title (4.7 The team uses Scrum with three-day sprints. Sprint Planning happens at the start of each sprint. Daily Scrum happens every work day. Sprint Review happens at the end of each sprint. Sprint Retrospective happens every two sprints, when roles change.)
  /Dest 519 0 R
>>
endobj

37 0 obj
<<
  /Parent 29 0 R
