  /Title (4.9 Maximum allowed time for the project: 18 full days (7.5 hours per day). The team must manage time, workload, stakeholder meetings, sprint ceremonies, and delivery autonomously. At the beginning of the project, inform your trainer of the team composition and planned start date.)
  /Dest 521 0 R
>>
endobj

